;;
;; The facts are authored HERE and nowhere else. src/association/facts.kotoba
;; (the Clojure reading) and src/association_facts.kotoba (the Kotoba port)
;; are both generated from this file by scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljk; run it
;; after editing, and `--check` says if either reading has drifted.
;;
;; Every entry carries the page it came from (:source-article) and the
;; verbatim span the claim rests on (:source-quote), in the Spanish the page
;; is written in. `kbb --backend sci scripts/verify-catalog.cljk --live`
;; fetches each :url and requires that span to still be in it.
;;
;; No personal names of office-holders are persisted here. The History page
;; names the founder next to the founding date, and the governance pages list
;; the people who sit on each organ; the spans quoted below stop before every
;; name, and no page is cited for its list of names.
;;
;; Every source is coparmex.org.mx. Figures COPARMEX gives about itself (its
;; membership, its share of GDP) are recorded as what COPARMEX states, not as
;; independently measured facts; the titles say so.

